WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.400
The AFC Asian Cup is the biggest national-team tournament in Asia.

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:09.060
In 2027 it comes to the Kingdom.

3
00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:15.340
Twenty-four nations, in six groups, playing fifty-one matches.

4
00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.010
Saudi Arabia plays in Group A.

5
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:25.590
Fans will come from every corner of Asia and the world - and many of them live here already.
